                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Super Slam Dunk Touchdown is a goofy game where a team of football, hockey, roller derby, and/or whatever other sportplayers kick or throw a bowling bowl or hockey puck or basketball or baseball or whatever downfield and try to 1) kick it into a soccer goal for one point, 2) kick it between the pipes of a field goal for two points, or 3) make a basket for three points.\n\nIt's fun for a little bit, mostly for the novelty of playing the variety of sports. Unfortunately, the game is ultimately pretty flat. There's a little variation in playstyle between the different players but in the end, gameplay is just: pass to your teammate before getting tackled, try to avoid the goalie moving across the goal mouth and score one of the points.\n\nI played on Steam Deck and it worked fine.",
